    "body": "Thanks @zcorpan, I've added a list of issues related to BFCache eligibility/eviction in the original post. It would be great if we can get the open issues, discussions and PRs around those resolved, e.g. https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/8972 for BroadcastChannel.\r\n\r\n> https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/6556 mentions that document.open() prevents bfcache in chromium (IIUC)\r\n\r\nIn Chrome's implementation, I don't think document.open() affects BFCache eligibility (intentionally, at least). I think there's been a bunch of changes around history too after that issue, maybe @domenic can comment more here (I'll try to repro soon too if needed)",
