    "created_at": "2023-06-14T18:37:48Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-06-14T18:37:48Z",
    "body": "> Is WebKit interested in changing `cache-control: no-store` such that it doesn't prevent bfcache?\r\n\r\nWe are. As a matter of fact we already tried. However, we had to revert our change because of complaints from banks (You log out of your bank account, then press back and still see your bank account). What's the plan to deal with this? (The clear-site-data HTTP header?).",
