    "body": "Making `clear-site-data: cache` (or `*`) prevent bfcache makes sense to me and could be a replacement for banks. I see you already implemented that in WebKit in https://github.com/WebKit/WebKit/pull/4617\r\n\r\nGecko removed \"cache\" in https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1671182 but I'll file a new bug to implement it. Edit: https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1838506",
